a partial merit badge for more than a year or six months.

215
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:38,060
The boys will just get lazy, and they won't do them,

216
00:18:38,120 --> 00:18:40,580
or they'll forget about them, and they'll waste all that time.

217
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:42,120
Well, that's really none of your business.

218
00:18:42,820 --> 00:18:45,660
Your troop can't make rules that change national policy.

219
00:18:46,700 --> 00:18:50,060
Boys do not have to be a certain age or a rank to challenge a merit badge.

